# Dance: a jaunty two-step at 120 bpm. The hips drop on every beat (the knees bend through the
# foot IK) and sway to alternate feet, the chest counters the pelvis, the elbows pump in
# opposition and the head bobs a little late. The left and right halves differ on purpose.
emote 2 Dance
duration 2.6
drag 0.035
pose L   hips=4,-5,0 pelvis=0,9,-6 spine=4,-4,4 chest=0,-12,5 head=6,7,-5 arm.R=48,-10,22 fore.R=104 hand.R=10 arm.L=-18,0,16 fore.L=78 hand.L=-6
pose R   hips=-4,-5,1 pelvis=0,-9,6 spine=4,4,-4 chest=0,12,-5 head=6,-7,6 arm.L=44,-10,20 fore.L=100 hand.L=10 arm.R=-16,0,14 fore.R=82 hand.R=-6
pose upL hips=1.5,-1,0 pelvis=0,3,-2 chest=-2,-4,2 head=-2,3,-2 arm.R=30,-10,20 fore.R=92 arm.L=0,0,18 fore.L=84
pose upR hips=-1.5,-1,0 pelvis=0,-3,2 chest=-2,4,-2 head=-2,-3,2 arm.L=28,-10,18 fore.L=90 arm.R=2,0,16 fore.R=86
key 0.00 rest
key 0.22 hips=0,-3,0 chest=4 head=4 arm.LR=8,0,14 fore.LR=60
key 0.50 hit @L
key 0.75 @upL step.R=0,4,4
key 1.00 hit @R step.R=0,0,0
key 1.25 @upR step.L=0,4,4
key 1.50 hit @L step.L=0,0,0
key 1.75 @upL step.R=0,4,4
key 2.00 hit @R hips=-3,-4,1 step.R=0,0,0
key 2.30 hips=0,-1,0 pelvis=0 spine=0 chest=-1,0,0 head=-2,0,0 arm.LR=8,0,12 fore.LR=40 hand.LR=0
key 2.58 rest
